@host = http://localhost:5106

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### OpenAPI document (Development only) — interactive UI at {{host}}/scalar
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auth
# Seeded accounts (password Password123!):
#   claimant1@example.com, claimant2@example.com, staff1@example.com, staff2@example.com, supervisor@example.com

### Register a new claimant
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.claimant@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "New Claimant"
}

### Log in (copy accessToken into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "claimant1@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Claimant (log in as claimant1 above)

### My policies (copy a policy id into @policyId)
GET {{host}}/api/policies/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@policyId = paste-policy-id-here

### Report an incident (amount in satang: 45,000.00 THB)
POST {{host}}/api/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyId": "{{policyId}}",
  "incidentType": "Collision",
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-25",
  "location": "Sukhumvit Rd, Bangkok",
  "description": "Rear-ended at a red light",
  "claimedAmount": 4500000
}

### My claims (optional: ?status=Submitted&page=1&pageSize=20)
GET {{host}}/api/claims/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@claimId = paste-claim-id-here

### Claim detail with timeline
GET {{host}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Withdraw (only while Submitted)
POST {{host}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@requestId = paste-information-request-id-here

### Answer a staff information request (claim goes back to UnderReview)
POST {{host}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}/information-requests/{{requestId}}/response
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "response": "Police report no. 1234/2569"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Staff (log in as staff1 and paste into @staffToken)
@staffToken = paste-staff-access-token-here

### Work queue: queue=Unassigned | Mine (omit for all), optional status, page, pageSize
GET {{host}}/api/staff/claims?queue=Unassigned
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Full claim detail (incl. claimant, policy, assessment)
GET {{host}}/api/staff/claims/{{claimId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Pick up the claim (409 if someone already has it)
POST {{host}}/api/staff/claims/{{claimId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Ask the claimant for more information
POST {{host}}/api/staff/claims/{{claimId}}/information-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Please send the police report number",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-02"
}

### Assess (amount in satang, must not exceed the claimed amount)
POST {{host}}/api/staff/claims/{{claimId}}/assessment
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessedAmount": 3500000,
  "summary": "Repair quote checked; bumper and tail light"
}

### Approve (amount ≤ assessed amount; note optional)
POST {{host}}/api/staff/claims/{{claimId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedAmount": 3000000,
  "note": "Deductible 5,000 THB applied"
}

### Reject (from UnderReview or Assessed; reason required)
POST {{host}}/api/staff/claims/{{claimId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Damage happened before the policy started"
}

### Record payment (after approval; transfer made outside the system)
POST {{host}}/api/staff/claims/{{claimId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentReference": "TRF-20261125-0001"
}
